			<h1>House Inventory System</h1>
			<p>The House Inventory System is a JavaFX application designed to allow users to organize and keep track of household items. Users are able
				to add locations and items to the inventory, edit items, remove items, view a specific item and even search the entire inventory for quick access. Users
				can view items in detail to find an items important details and quantity amounts. The system is designed to make it easier for users to 
				find items and maintain an organized household.
			</p>
